  "description": "<p>Currently you can delete just the description from a binary. But once it is gone you can't recreate it.</p>\n\n<p>See <a href=\"https://gist.github.com/whikloj/22747a594194da6072c8c1fd745760ea\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://gist.github.com/whikloj/22747a594194da6072c8c1fd745760ea</a> for demonstration.</p>\n\n<p>Questions:</p>\n\n<p>Should you be able to delete the description?</p>\n\n<p>If yes, then how do we re-create it?</p>\n\n<p>If no, then what is the response?</p>",
